option.BLOOM_DOWNSAMPLE_BLUR_RADIUS.comment=Selects the bloom gaussian kernel width (1-2: 9-tap; 3-5: 17-tap; 6-9: 25-tap; 10+: 33-tap). The blur is isotropic, so point lights no longer split into four petals

option.EXPOSURE_MODE=Exposure Mode
value.EXPOSURE_MODE.MANUAL=Manual
value.EXPOSURE_MODE.AUTO_BASIC=Auto Basic
value.EXPOSURE_MODE.AUTO_HISTOGRAM=Auto Histogram
option.EXPOSURE_MODE.comment=Exposure control mode. Manual = fixed EV value; Auto Histogram = auto-adjusts from a luminance histogram (follows day/night and indoor/outdoor brightness)

option.EXPOSURE_SPEED_DOWN=Exposure Speed Down
option.EXPOSURE_SPEED_DOWN.comment=Adaptation speed when the scene darkens (entering shade/caves). Higher = faster adaptation
option.EXPOSURE_SPEED_UP=Exposure Speed Up
option.EXPOSURE_SPEED_UP.comment=Adaptation speed when the scene brightens (leaving indoors / facing strong light). Higher = faster
option.AUTO_EV_BIAS=Auto EV Bias
option.AUTO_EV_BIAS.comment=Overall brightness bias added to the auto-exposure target. Positive = brighter, negative = darker
option.AUTO_EV_MAX=Auto EV Max
option.AUTO_EV_MAX.comment=Maximum EV allowed for auto exposure (bright clamp). Higher lets bright scenes get brighter
option.AUTO_EV_MIN=Auto EV Min
option.AUTO_EV_MIN.comment=Minimum EV allowed for auto exposure (dark clamp). Lower lets night/interiors get darker
option.HISTOGRAM_BIN_COUNT=Histogram Bin Count
option.HISTOGRAM_BIN_COUNT.comment=Number of luminance histogram bins. Higher = finer brightness sampling (slightly higher cost)
option.HISTOGRAM_LOWER_BOUND=Histogram Lower Bound
option.HISTOGRAM_LOWER_BOUND.comment=Fraction of darkest pixels ignored by auto exposure (0.4 = ignore the darkest 40%). Higher avoids very dark pixels pulling exposure up
option.HISTOGRAM_UPPER_BOUND=Histogram Upper Bound
option.HISTOGRAM_UPPER_BOUND.comment=Fraction beyond which the brightest pixels are ignored (0.8 = ignore the brightest 20%). Lower reduces interference from strong lights (sun/torches)
option.MANUAL_EV=Manual EV
option.MANUAL_EV.comment=EV value used in Manual exposure mode. Higher = darker, lower = brighter (default 2.0 is neutral)

option.PURKINJE_SHIFT=Purkinje Shift
option.PURKINJE_SHIFT_STRENGTH=Purkinje Shift Strength
option.PURKINJE_SHIFT_NOISE=Purkinje Shift Noise
